  "definition": "“Chief medical examiner” (CME) means the licensed physician certified by the American Board of Pathology as a qualified pathologist and appointed pursuant to RS",
  "effectiveDate": "2007-07-14",
  "historyNote": "#8937, eff 7-14-07",
